{
  "info": {
    "name": "SALUD · Administrador",
    "description": "Recorrido de un usuario **administrador**, en orden y encadenado por el entorno.\n\nAltas, concesión de roles y las tres bajas lógicas de plataforma: bloquear una cuenta, suspender una organización y anonimizar a una persona. Ninguna borra: lo que se firmó tiene que seguir existiendo.\n\nImportar junto a `Salud-Administrador.postman_environment.json` y correr los pasos de arriba abajo. Cada actor tiene su propio entorno: con uno solo, iniciar sesión como otro borraría este token.\n\nLos pasos son los mismos que ejercita `test/smoke/modules/administrador.smoke.ts` contra la API real, y `yarn postman:verify:actores` los vuelve a correr sobre esta colección.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "1 · Inicia sesión como administrador",
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Content-Type",
            "value": "application/json"
          }
        ],
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/iam/auth/login",
          "host": [
            "{{baseUrl}}"
          ],
          "path": [
            "iam",
            "auth",
            "login"
          ],
          "variable": []
        },
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"{{email}}\",\n  \"password\": \"{{password}}\"\n}",
          "options": {
            "raw": {
              "language": "json"
            }
          }
        },
        "auth": {
          "type": "noauth"
        },
        "description": "El primer SECURITY_ADMIN no se puede crear por API: lo siembra `yarn postman:bootstrap`."
      },
      "response": [],
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "pm.test('status 200', function () {",
              "  pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
              "});",
              "",
              "// Encadena el recorrido: lo que deja este paso lo consume el siguiente.",
              "if (pm.response.code < 300) {",
              "  const b = pm.response.json();",
              "  if (b.accessToken) pm.environment.set('accessToken', b.accessToken);",
              "  if (b.refreshToken) pm.environment.set('refreshToken', b.refreshToken);",
              "}"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "2 · Da de alta una cuenta",
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Content-Type",
            "value": "application/json"
          }
        ],
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/iam/users",
          "host": [
            "{{baseUrl}}"
          ],
          "path": [
            "iam",
            "users"
          ],
          "variable": []
        },
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"displayName\": \"Usuario gestionado\",\n  \"email\": \"{{managedEmail}}\",\n  \"password\": \"{{password}}\",\n  \"initialRole\": \"USER\"\n}",
          "options": {
            "raw": {
              "language": "json"
            }
          }
        },
        "description": "Sólo `USER` y `SECURITY_ADMIN` son roles de alta."
      },
      "response": [],
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "prerequest",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "pm.environment.set('managedEmail', 'gestionado-' + Date.now() + '@example.test');"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "pm.test('status 201', function () {",
              "  pm.response.to.have.status(201);",
              "});",
              "",
              "// Encadena el recorrido: lo que deja este paso lo consume el siguiente.",
              "if (pm.response.code < 300) {",
              "  const b = pm.response.json();",
              "  if (b.id) pm.environment.set('managedUserId', b.id);",
              "}"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "3 · Le concede SECURITY_ADMIN",
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Content-Type",
            "value": "application/json"
          }
        ],
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/iam/users/:managedUserId/global-roles",
          "host": [
            "{{baseUrl}}"
          ],
          "path": [
            "iam",
            "users",
            ":managedUserId",
            "global-roles"
          ],
          "variable": [
            {
              "key": "managedUserId",
              "value": "{{managedUserId}}",
              "description": "Lo deja en el entorno un paso anterior"
            }
          ]
        },
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"role\": \"SECURITY_ADMIN\",\n  \"action\": \"GRANT\"\n}",
          "options": {
            "raw": {
              "language": "json"
            }
          }
        },
        "description": ""
      },
      "response": [],
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "pm.test('status 200', function () {",
              "  pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
              "});"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "4 · Y se lo revoca",
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Content-Type",
            "value": "application/json"
          }
        ],
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/iam/users/:managedUserId/global-roles",
          "host": [
            "{{baseUrl}}"
          ],
          "path": [
            "iam",
            "users",
            ":managedUserId",
            "global-roles"
          ],
          "variable": [
            {
              "key": "managedUserId",
              "value": "{{managedUserId}}",
              "description": "Lo deja en el entorno un paso anterior"
            }
          ]
        },
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"role\": \"SECURITY_ADMIN\",\n  \"action\": \"REVOKE\"\n}",
          "options": {
            "raw": {
              "language": "json"
            }
          }
        },
        "description": ""
      },
      "response": [],
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "pm.test('status 200', function () {",
              "  pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
              "});"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "5 · Aprovisiona una organización con su owner",
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Content-Type",
            "value": "application/json"
          }
        ],
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/admin/tenants",
          "host": [
            "{{baseUrl}}"
          ],
          "path": [
            "admin",
            "tenants"
          ],
          "variable": []
        },
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"code\": \"{{admTenantCode}}\",\n  \"legalName\": \"Organización aprovisionada\",\n  \"tenantType\": \"MEDICAL_OFFICE\",\n  \"countryConceptId\": \"{{countryConceptId}}\",\n  \"jurisdictionConceptId\": \"{{jurisdictionConceptId}}\",\n  \"ownerUserId\": \"{{managedUserId}}\"\n}",
          "options": {
            "raw": {
              "language": "json"
            }
          }
        },
        "description": ""
      },
      "response": [],
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "prerequest",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "pm.environment.set('admTenantCode', 'ADM-' + Date.now());"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "pm.test('status 201', function () {",
              "  pm.response.to.have.status(201);",
              "});",
              "",
              "// Encadena el recorrido: lo que deja este paso lo consume el siguiente.",
              "if (pm.response.code < 300) {",
              "  const b = pm.response.json();",
              "  if (b.id) pm.environment.set('admTenantId', b.id);",
              "}"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "6 · La verifica y la deja ACTIVA",
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [],
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/admin/tenants/:admTenantId/verification",
          "host": [
            "{{baseUrl}}"
          ],
          "path": [
            "admin",
            "tenants",
            ":admTenantId",
            "verification"
          ],
          "variable": [
            {
              "key": "admTenantId",
              "value": "{{admTenantId}}",
              "description": "Lo deja en el entorno un paso anterior"
            }
          ]
        },
        "description": "Acto de plataforma: el owner no llega a este endpoint."
      },
      "response": [],
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "pm.test('status 200', function () {",
              "  pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
              "});"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "7 · La suspende — baja lógica, sigue existiendo",
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Content-Type",
            "value": "application/json"
          }
        ],
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/admin/tenants/:admTenantId/suspend",
          "host": [
            "{{baseUrl}}"
          ],
          "path": [
            "admin",
            "tenants",
            ":admTenantId",
            "suspend"
          ],
          "variable": [
            {
              "key": "admTenantId",
              "value": "{{admTenantId}}",
              "description": "Lo deja en el entorno un paso anterior"
            }
          ]
        },
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"reason\": \"Motivo de la suspensión\"\n}",
          "options": {
            "raw": {
              "language": "json"
            }
          }
        },
        "description": "De la organización cuelgan historias clínicas, facturación y consentimientos: un borrado dejaría todo eso apuntando al vacío. El motivo es obligatorio porque estas decisiones se revisan."
      },
      "response": [],
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "pm.test('status 200', function () {",
              "  pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
              "});"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "8 · Bloquea la cuenta — baja lógica",
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Content-Type",
            "value": "application/json"
          }
        ],
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/iam/users/:managedUserId/lock",
          "host": [
            "{{baseUrl}}"
          ],
          "path": [
            "iam",
            "users",
            ":managedUserId",
            "lock"
          ],
          "variable": [
            {
              "key": "managedUserId",
              "value": "{{managedUserId}}",
              "description": "Lo deja en el entorno un paso anterior"
            }
          ]
        },
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"reason\": \"Motivo del bloqueo\"\n}",
          "options": {
            "raw": {
              "language": "json"
            }
          }
        },
        "description": "Le corta el acceso; la cuenta sigue existiendo porque de ella cuelgan sus actos. Después de esto su login devuelve 401."
      },
      "response": [],
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "pm.test('status 200', function () {",
              "  pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
              "});"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "9 · LÍMITE · la cuenta bloqueada ya no entra",
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Content-Type",
            "value": "application/json"
          }
        ],
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/iam/auth/login",
          "host": [
            "{{baseUrl}}"
          ],
          "path": [
            "iam",
            "auth",
            "login"
          ],
          "variable": []
        },
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"{{managedEmail}}\",\n  \"password\": \"{{password}}\"\n}",
          "options": {
            "raw": {
              "language": "json"
            }
          }
        },
        "auth": {
          "type": "noauth"
        },
        "description": "Este paso **debe** dar 401: es la prueba de que el bloqueo sirve."
      },
      "response": [],
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "pm.test('status 401', function () {",
              "  pm.response.to.have.status(401);",
              "});"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "10 · Derecho al olvido — vacía sin borrar",
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [],
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/iam/users/:managedUserId/anonymize",
          "host": [
            "{{baseUrl}}"
          ],
          "path": [
            "iam",
            "users",
            ":managedUserId",
            "anonymize"
          ],
          "variable": [
            {
              "key": "managedUserId",
              "value": "{{managedUserId}}",
              "description": "Lo deja en el entorno un paso anterior"
            }
          ]
        },
        "description": "No es una baja más: se vacían los datos personales pero la fila queda, porque los actos que esa persona firmó son parte de la historia de otros pacientes."
      },
      "response": [],
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "pm.test('status 200', function () {",
              "  pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
              "});"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "auth": {
    "type": "bearer",
    "bearer": [
      {
        "key": "token",
        "value": "{{accessToken}}",
        "type": "string"
      }
    ]
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "baseUrl",
      "value": "http://localhost:3000",
      "type": "string"
    }
  ]
}
